masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2023年3月9日\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed （机械干燥）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：番石榴、蔓越莓、葡萄柚\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Guava, Cranberry, Grapefruit\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：马拉维瑰夏 Malawi Gesha\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          竞标批次：EI05-C\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          地块：小松 Los Pinos\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           种植海拔：1890米 masl\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2023年3月9日\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          处理方式：日晒 Natural\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           （晒场地面 Patio）\n          </span>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：柑橘、红苹果、羊角蜜、夏威夷果\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Citrus, Red apple, Hami melon, Macadamia nuts\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：中美洲瑰夏种 Gesha Central America\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          竞标批次：EI02-A\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          地块：\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Las Milpas\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           种植海拔：1920米 masl\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2023年4月12日\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：日晒 Natural （晒场地面 Patio）\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          风味：花香，柚子\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          、橙子、绿葡萄、红苹果\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Pomelo, Orange, Green grape, Red apple\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这只是Legendary瑰夏的竞标批次，它有艾力达Plano的细腻又兼顾了绝色的酸甜感，甜感特别的饱满，酸感非常的明亮上扬。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          为什么叫中美洲种，是因为茵赫特很早很早前，可能是中南美洲或者说全球产区里第一个区分种植的瑰夏品种的庄园，当时大家都只知道巴拿马瑰夏，埃塞的瑰夏市场上也没有，但是对于茵赫特来说他们知道庄园里或者说咖啡种植的领域里有早先年埃塞经由坦桑到哥斯达黎加再到巴拿马的“瑰夏”，后来经由翡翠一战成名后再中南美洲推广起来，茵赫特把它定义为“中美洲瑰夏种”意思是这个品种在中美洲适应下来；另外一类瑰夏，在茵赫特种植的是从非洲埃塞瑰夏的原发地再次引种（直接引种到庄园）的瑰夏就被定义为“非洲种”瑰夏，风味上确实两个品种是有差异的，也就是从那个时候开始这种叫法就在茵赫特固定下来；相似的区分方式在圣塔菲蕾莎也有，比如说我们今年买到的有非洲种瑰夏和Gesha2722（即茵赫特的中美洲瑰夏种），更有趣的时，年初我们采购埃塞Gelena农场的豆子时，生豆伙伴从埃塞的农场贸易商那边获得的反馈是Gelena的瑰夏是从巴拿马引种回去的中美洲瑰夏种，所以豆子里会有一些类似巴拿马瑰夏的长型豆子，真是兜兜转转～以上是我们自己了解到的一些关于瑰夏这个品种的认识\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibJjrCNLzW6rkx1N8NJ5Bict9YwsTAVtdJK6fbMibgym3iayK1WiciaUD14qQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 787px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: justify;\">\n           谁与争锋的获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CoE 第一名：2006(Bourbon), 2008(Pacamara), 2009(Pacamara), 2010(Pacamara), 2012(Pacamara), 2013(Pacamara), 2015(Pacamara), 2019(Pacamara), 2021(Gesha)\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CoE 第二名：2014(Pacamara), 2017(Gesha)\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CoE 第三名：2002, 2011(Maragogype), 2019(Pacamara)\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          CoE 第五名：2003, 2007(Bourbon)\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9dqUibasU80mkcHUpFa65x1GBENQUHEVYDEibrHwE7rAF3y0l7HF44GHJQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           关于茵赫特庄园 EL INJERTO\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Injerto庄园坐落在薇薇特南果咖啡产区中，有着陡峭的群峰和狭隘的山谷，接受来自邻近的墨西哥低地山谷温暖的热风，热空气温暖山腰，使得咖啡可以在如此高的海拔上生长。咖啡栽种密度并不高，同时采取遮阴种植，整个庄园总共有林地720公顷，其中保留了470公顷作为原始林，种植咖啡的林地分为14个区块（可能更多了，这是我2015年去茵赫特问到的资料），分别种植不同的品种或者混种种植。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9dnYNYrO4tSsRShppb08Y0s1T8BTh57sOXlicFbYhoiaTEH4TIice00ibDDg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jesús Aguirre Panamá 是这个农场的第一个所有者，他在 1874 年收购了这个农场。他开始种植甘蔗来生产被称为“panela”（红糖面包）的结晶糖、玉米、豆类和烟草。1900 年左右，他开始种植和生产咖啡，并将农场称为 EL INJERTO，“injerto”是该地区原产的水果的名称。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9dDGvYpY2hXtbGLwKicudHMaicx7WqJtG4YEYqRNrXyOKFbO15KXwf8CBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 14px;\">\n          图为Arturo Aguirre Sr &amp; Jr\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          茵赫特庄园种植的第一批瑰夏种子是由Aguirre先生去巴拿马旅行，从他的朋友翡翠庄园那拿到的。庄园很荣幸能拿到这批种子，也按照它的天性去培育它，把它称为皇家豆（Royal Beans）。这就是为什么在出名后大家把它称作“传奇瑰夏”。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          PEÑA BLANCA地块是茵赫特种植瑰夏的第二个地块，比Los Pinos地块晚种植一年。地块面朝农场的西面，所以一般要到下午太阳才会晒到这里。瑰夏苗都种在一棵繁茂的遮阴树下。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9dCVQN1dlpYhbkjNrjNfUQIgaFFibwRworFTvoic9ia4Ihh4ZcGtF2GoPRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程：双重发酵处理法（Double Fermentation），原计划是用不锈钢桶进行前期的鲜果发酵，但是因为桶全部在山下，运上来比较困难，后来一个经理想出来何不用水洗用的发酵池，于是这一批次就是鲜果在发酵池里无水静置了5天，期间用塑胶布罩起来使得里面仅有微量的氧气残留参与发酵；5天后，鲜果取出来进行脱皮，脱皮后带着果胶的再无水静置发酵48小时，之后就是常规的清洗与清洗后的一天清水中静置。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9dBGcr5N4RyCeBWrYZk8nHeOb7pHLdTXVCEtR3ibM9Bia401gbA7LFibW6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今天，农场由 Aguirre 家族的第三代和第四代管理， 1956 年以来他们就一直在农场工作，当时的产量约为三百袋羊皮纸咖啡。现在，他们与一个伟大的团队合作，并肩负着相同的使命，生产精品咖啡；保持对环境友好的农业实践，专注于企业社会责任，实现新的农场管理方式，对所有相关方都有更多的经济可行性，这些年来，他们专门生产高品质的咖啡。为了能够做到这一点，他们在调查、技术和教育方面投入了大量资金。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SSWlUpkc0k70UUnp5bvk9d9z9JXfAMpTsdAJo7wibZ3JxlsaScEIHOjQZ5NRjWE1n1J6Hy5dU4tLQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          茵赫特庄园鼓励咖啡种植应当真实地表达其风土特点，展现当地的气候和土壤属性带来的影响。尊重和了解品种的原产地是指导咖啡种植的前提；整个种植园都使用不同的遮阴树比如印加树、银桦树、澳洲坚果树和树冠来给咖啡树苗遮荫。庄园的电力全部是由自行建立的水力发电设施供给，可产1000KW电力，不光自给自足，还可以卖给政府，超强！\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Malawi Ruby Gesha\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          马拉维瑰夏，是庄园从一个马拉维的咖农朋友手里获得，它比庄园里其他的瑰夏个头会小一点，果子成熟后似红宝石色，所以也被称之为红宝石瑰夏 Ruby Gesha。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          茵赫特的马拉维瑰夏曾经获得危地马拉2017年CoE的第三名。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SlF7t1bCQiaCvKcZtGiawDyN4R1qAjxY2gAMd3eB7IiaBvn5oERfiaVZQVho2PmNDL4DtHpL5xzrIuCQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
